  "description": "First floor side extension with window to front",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed first-floor side extension, by reason of its lack of set back from the main front wall of the host dwellinghouse, its insubordination to the host dwellinghouse, and its flat roof design, would fail to respect the character and design of the host dwellinghouse and neighbouring properties. The proposal would therefore result in a detrimental impact to the character and appearance of the host dwellinghouse and the visual amenities of the area, contrary to the high quality design aspirations of National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 (D.1, D.11 and D.12) of the London Plan (2021), Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
